<title>USA: United Tech sees EPS momentum into 1997.</title>
<headline>United Tech sees EPS momentum into 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp said Thursday it expects to continue the momentum it saw in 1996, which had 21 percent per share earnings growth and continued strong cash generation.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to carry that momentum into 1997 and beyond,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>The company's 1996 earnings were $3.45 per share, up from $2.85 in 1995.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter earnings were $0.87, up from $0.71.</p>
